  "purpose": "Machine-readable terminal-claim registry for the RELEASE-01 Proof-Carrying Interop V2 §38 contract. This is the terminal layer above the WORD (LAB-01), GOOGLE (GOOGLE-01), MULTI-01 and CAPABILITY_MATRIX contours: it binds every public Word/DOCX product wording string to a typed claim, a profile class and committed evidence, and records NOT_CLAIMED_BLOCKED claims for Google profiles, Windows Word, Word Online, the MULTI_SCENE_COORDINATOR blocked row, the not-yet-made Word saturation claim and current Word build compatibility. The Word 16.112 migration preserves 16.111.3 evidence as historical non-transferable evidence; no physical claim is inherited by the current profile. This registry is read-only evidence; it grants no product write authority and never changes Word or Google saturation status.",
